// 基准：std/map。整数键的插入和查找，字符串键的计数，最后借用遍历一遍；整个过程做 4 轮
import "std/map"

fn one_round(seed: int) -> int {
    m: map.Map[int, int] = map.new()
    n = 200000
    for i in 0..n { m.insert((i + seed) * 7919 % 1000003, i) }
    hit = 0
    for _ in 0..5 {
        for i in 0..n { hit += m.get((i + seed) * 7919 % 1000003) ?? 0 }
    }
    keys: [str] = []
    for i in 0..20000 { keys.push("词#{(i + seed) % 5000}") }
    ws: map.Map[str, int] = map.new()
    for _ in 0..20 {
        for k in keys {
            c = ws.get(k) ?? 0
            ws.insert(k, c + 1)
        }
    }
    total = 0
    for _ in 0..20 {
        for (w, v) in ws { total += v + len(w) }
    }
    hit + len(ws) + total
}

fn main() {
    sum = 0
    for r in 0..4 { sum += one_round(r) }
    print("#{sum}")
}
